msgstr ".. image:: ../wireless-tv-shield-hero.jpg"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Wireless TV Shield product"
" page <https://openmv.io/products/wireless-tv-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Kompletní datasheet, fotografie a možnosti objednání najdete na `produktové "
"stránce Wireless TV Shield <https://openmv.io/products/wireless-tv-"
"shield>`_\\ ."

